description:
Installs a package from a URI. Can be used on any URI, both local and remote;
Important: use this to import/install assets from the Asset Library
Note: Some packages are automatically instantiated in the scene after installation. Use scene introspection before attempting instantiation to avoid duplicates.

inputSchema:
exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__lens_studio__asset_graphql(args: {
  // The GraphQL query or mutation string
  query: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

